{"id":921526,"title":"结束语 & 结课测试","content":"<p>我们的课程已经结课了。非常感谢你一直以来的认真学习和支持！</p><p>为了帮你检验自己的学习效果，我特意给你准备了一套结课测试题（可以重复体验）。这套测试题包含 17 单选题、3道多选题，考点都来自我们前面讲到的重要知识。点击下面按钮开始测试吧！  <a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=9205&exam_id=20607\"><img src=\"https://static001.geekbang.org/resource/image/28/a4/28d1be62669b4f3cc01c36466bf811a4.png?wh=1142*201\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>最后，我还给你准备了一份<a href=\"https://jinshuju.com/f/snWl0B\">结课问卷</a>，希望你能花两分钟填写一下，非常期待能听到你对这门课的反馈。</p>","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403894,"user_name":"心若常在","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3170197,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"E3E3D82A285A43","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/30/5f/95/444cea20.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1765268114,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101054401,"comment_content":"代码哪里看？","like_count":0}]}